# Machine profile: meter-idex (hostnames meter*, a3dpmeter*).
# Services enabled at first boot — one per line.
# Bed gate (image v0.1.4, supersedes the earlier meter-specific exclusion):
# ships on ALL printer profiles in fail-open/dry-run defaults — the daemon
# runs but a fresh unit has no occupancy verdicts and the detection worker
# has POSTING OFF (A3DP_BEDGATE_DETECT_POST=0), so the gate is present but
# inert until a human calibrates detection per DETECTION-SPEC.md. Macros
# hook into the profile's own euclid.cfg wrappers (builtin wrappers stripped
# in macros/bed-gate.cfg — same pattern as the a3dp4006mm hand deploy).
a3dp-bedgate
